(4156834, 597358, 67834, '<td valign="top">this is a bold attempt. I''ve never attempted Macro photography myself although I understand from various articles I have read that it is extremely difficult to achieve focus. In my honest opinion it is in this aspect that the shot falls short as there is just not enough of the fly in focus. Also the white mark to the bottom left of the fly (not sure what this is?) is slightly distracting. However, I congratulate you on a great effort 7</td>', 'this is a bold attempt. I''ve never attempted Macro photography myself although I understand from various articles I have read that it is extremely difficult to achieve focus. In my honest opinion it is in this aspect that the shot falls short as there is just not enough of the fly in focus. Also the white mark to the bottom left of the fly (not sure what this is?) is slightly distracting. However, I congratulate you on a great effort 7', '2007-10-10 08:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4156845, 597407, 52992, '<td valign="top">Oh my - is that little guy as tiny as he looks ?</td>', 'Oh my - is that little guy as tiny as he looks ?', '2007-10-10 09:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
