(4156938, 597316, 60614, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic capture.  The silhouette of the birds is so crisp.  I love the tones.</td>', 'What a fantastic capture.  The silhouette of the birds is so crisp.  I love the tones.', '2007-10-10 09:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4156939, 598169, 20608, '<td valign="top">Very brave of you to enter this. I''m sure you are getting battered for it by the voters.. I''m not voting in this challenge because I am in it but I think it is a very sad but excellent shot of what happens naturally within the struggle for food... LIFE in general. It made me feel a little sick to be honest but shit happens and SALUTE for submitting it.<br/> <br/>Technically it could use more focus but the composition is good and the snakes tongue is hanging out in anticipation of it''s freshly killed dinner. I would of given an 8. Good luck.</td>', 'Very brave of you to enter this. I''m sure you are getting battered for it by the voters.. I''m not voting in this challenge because I am in it but I think it is a very sad but excellent shot of what happens naturally within the struggle for food... LIFE in general. It made me feel a little sick to be honest but shit happens and SALUTE for submitting it. Technically it could use more focus but the composition is good and the snakes tongue is hanging out in anticipation of it''s freshly killed dinner. I would of given an 8. Good luck.', '2007-10-10 09:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4156955, 595099, 58457, '<td valign="top">needs a bit of work, practice and learning</td>', 'needs a bit of work, practice and learning', '2007-10-10 09:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
