(4157087, 598169, 74911, '<td valign="top">This can''t get any better than this... Excellent timing... a perfect exposure... a decent point of view to have the faces of both the killer and the killed visible... I like everything about this shot... Eager to see your note on how you took this... This should ribbon in my opinion...</td>', 'This can''t get any better than this... Excellent timing... a perfect exposure... a decent point of view to have the faces of both the killer and the killed visible... I like everything about this shot... Eager to see your note on how you took this... This should ribbon in my opinion...', '2007-10-10 10:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4157091, 597760, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  I gave it a 9.  I think with a more interesting backdrop and just a *teeny* bit more sharpness at the bottom of the chick, this could have easily been 10 material.</td>', 'Very cute!  I gave it a 9.  I think with a more interesting backdrop and just a *teeny* bit more sharpness at the bottom of the chick, this could have easily been 10 material.', '2007-10-10 10:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
