(4157454, 596129, 65811, '<td valign="top">Dramatic lighting.  Those in-camera flashes can be a real pain in the ass when it comes to photographing kitties.  I put Kleenex over my flash to diffuse the light :P.  It doesn''t always work though.  Sometimes, converting it to a Black/White photo will "hide" the reflective eyes.  Using the Unsharp Mask filter can also help hightlight that cuddly looking fur.</td>', 'Dramatic lighting.  Those in-camera flashes can be a real pain in the ass when it comes to photographing kitties.  I put Kleenex over my flash to diffuse the light :P.  It doesn''t always work though.  Sometimes, converting it to a Black/White photo will "hide" the reflective eyes.  Using the Unsharp Mask filter can also help hightlight that cuddly looking fur.', '2007-10-10 12:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
