(4157579, 598263, 65811, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  The thing to note about reds, is that they can "strain" the eye when you''re looking at them.  That being said, I like how both the butterfly and the flower jump out at you. The tone of both the red and green appear to be equal.</td>', 'Very pretty.  The thing to note about reds, is that they can "strain" the eye when you''re looking at them.  That being said, I like how both the butterfly and the flower jump out at you. The tone of both the red and green appear to be equal.', '2007-10-10 12:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
