(4157921, 596286, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of heavy in the shadows, my eye goes right to that bright spot on his behind instead. Perhaps some adjustments of curves or shadow detail woudl bring it out better.</td>', 'Kind of heavy in the shadows, my eye goes right to that bright spot on his behind instead. Perhaps some adjustments of curves or shadow detail woudl bring it out better.', '2007-10-10 15:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4157926, 596762, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love that texture of his scales. Too much brightness in the background pulls my view away from the subject.</td>', 'Love that texture of his scales. Too much brightness in the background pulls my view away from the subject.', '2007-10-10 15:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4157929, 598158, 83313, '<td valign="top">What a glare he seems to be giving! I would have liked to see some more detail in his front, but that''s nitpicking.</td>', 'What a glare he seems to be giving! I would have liked to see some more detail in his front, but that''s nitpicking.', '2007-10-10 15:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4157933, 597280, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good shot of this guy. Composition seems lacking, but animals don''t exactly pose for you. You take them how they come!</td>', 'Good shot of this guy. Composition seems lacking, but animals don''t exactly pose for you. You take them how they come!', '2007-10-10 15:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4157934, 597371, 83313, '<td valign="top">His colors match the leaves quite nicely.</td>', 'His colors match the leaves quite nicely.', '2007-10-10 15:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4157947, 597626, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good shot, with good DOF, especially since you probably had to use a lot of zoom. The squirrels I am familiar with won''t let me get anywhere near that close.</td>', 'Good shot, with good DOF, especially since you probably had to use a lot of zoom. The squirrels I am familiar with won''t let me get anywhere near that close.', '2007-10-10 15:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4157950, 597692, 85155, '<td valign="top">I think the composition in this picture is okay, but it is really hard to look at because it isn''t very sharp.  It seems like the picture is out of focus, try fixing this with a lens sharpen.  I think it follows the theme well, and rather than just showing an animal, it actually shows animals doing what they do.</td>', 'I think the composition in this picture is okay, but it is really hard to look at because it isn''t very sharp.  It seems like the picture is out of focus, try fixing this with a lens sharpen.  I think it follows the theme well, and rather than just showing an animal, it actually shows animals doing what they do.', '2007-10-10 15:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4157961, 598409, 85155, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition.  I love the color and the contrast in the image.  I think that they eyes could use some catch light or something so that they aren''t just black.  It kind of makes it feel like she is dead, maybe stuffed, making the eyes show up will make her look more alive.  I think that my favorite for this challenge will be an animal doing something, animal life, rather than just a picture of an animal, so you are getting a little lower rating for that reason, not because I don''t like the picture.</td>', 'This is a great composition.  I love the color and the contrast in the image.  I think that they eyes could use some catch light or something so that they aren''t just black.  It kind of makes it feel like she is dead, maybe stuffed, making the eyes show up will make her look more alive.  I think that my favorite for this challenge will be an animal doing something, animal life, rather than just a picture of an animal, so you are getting a little lower rating for that reason, not because I don''t like the picture.', '2007-10-10 15:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4157962, 598033, 62623, '<td valign="top">Too much flora not enough fauna</td>', 'Too much flora not enough fauna', '2007-10-10 15:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4157968, 596286, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of this zebra.  I like how it is standing.  However, the smaller animal is distracting to me, I kind of get the feeling that the zebra is looking at me, not the animal, so the other animal doesn''t add to the picture.  Also the dark background on the top makes the zebra''s neck kind of blend in, so it is really flat there, it doesn''t give the appearance of 3d.</td>', 'Nice shot of this zebra.  I like how it is standing.  However, the smaller animal is distracting to me, I kind of get the feeling that the zebra is looking at me, not the animal, so the other animal doesn''t add to the picture.  Also the dark background on the top makes the zebra''s neck kind of blend in, so it is really flat there, it doesn''t give the appearance of 3d.', '2007-10-10 15:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4157973, 596091, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of this praying mantis, I love the clarity in the eyes, and I love the bokeh(dof) here.  This isn''t the most interesting subject to me personally, and my top votes are going to shots of animals that seem to be doing something, but overall this is a great shot.</td>', 'Nice shot of this praying mantis, I love the clarity in the eyes, and I love the bokeh(dof) here.  This isn''t the most interesting subject to me personally, and my top votes are going to shots of animals that seem to be doing something, but overall this is a great shot.', '2007-10-10 15:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4157976, 597642, 85155, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, I love the composition.  There is a great line formed by the heads that are raised up, that leads me straight to the "guest" in this performance.  Another thing I like about this shot is that it isn''t just some animal, but rather an animal doing something, and you capture here two things these guys do best, lounge around and sing.  The only thing that is distracting to me in this picture is the flipper that is sticking up in the top right.</td>', 'This is a great shot, I love the composition.  There is a great line formed by the heads that are raised up, that leads me straight to the "guest" in this performance.  Another thing I like about this shot is that it isn''t just some animal, but rather an animal doing something, and you capture here two things these guys do best, lounge around and sing.  The only thing that is distracting to me in this picture is the flipper that is sticking up in the top right.', '2007-10-10 15:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4157991, 595697, 85155, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best shots that jumped out at me when scanning through the thumbnails.  I love the silhouette here and the fact that your subject is doing something, rather than just sitting there looking at the camera.  I love the full wingspan and the dof, I''m not sure what else I can say about this shot, it should be a ribbon winner in my opinion.</td>', 'This is one of the best shots that jumped out at me when scanning through the thumbnails.  I love the silhouette here and the fact that your subject is doing something, rather than just sitting there looking at the camera.  I love the full wingspan and the dof, I''m not sure what else I can say about this shot, it should be a ribbon winner in my opinion.', '2007-10-10 15:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
