(4158942, 598140, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like how sharp this image is and the other ducks in the background give balance to the main duck in the front.  I would like to see the duck doing something though, rather than just standing there.  The colors and contrast are great, overall this is a good shot.</td>', 'I like how sharp this image is and the other ducks in the background give balance to the main duck in the front.  I would like to see the duck doing something though, rather than just standing there.  The colors and contrast are great, overall this is a good shot.', '2007-10-10 21:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4158947, 596751, 85155, '<td valign="top">I''m happy to see that they eyes aren''t black here, without catch light, especially in animals, the eyes can make them look dead.  I also like how the monkey is looking off into the distance.  I do wish that the greenery around was a darker green though.</td>', 'I''m happy to see that they eyes aren''t black here, without catch light, especially in animals, the eyes can make them look dead.  I also like how the monkey is looking off into the distance.  I do wish that the greenery around was a darker green though.', '2007-10-10 22:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4158952, 598038, 85155, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot, I especially like how the eagle is looking through the rest of the picture, nice job leaving that space to the top and right.  For this specific challenge I would rather see the bird doing something though, the them fauna to me is animal life, which, in my mind, has the animals doing something.  Great shot though.</td>', 'This is a cool shot, I especially like how the eagle is looking through the rest of the picture, nice job leaving that space to the top and right.  For this specific challenge I would rather see the bird doing something though, the them fauna to me is animal life, which, in my mind, has the animals doing something.  Great shot though.', '2007-10-10 22:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4158957, 596029, 85155, '<td valign="top">Great bokeh in this shot.  I like the clarity and the colors of the frog against the tree.</td>', 'Great bokeh in this shot.  I like the clarity and the colors of the frog against the tree.', '2007-10-10 22:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4158963, 598309, 85155, '<td valign="top">For me there is too much sky and there is nothing in the sky.  It seems as though you were trying to keep in with the rule of thirds here, I would suggest moving the subject to the top third instead of the bottom third, the field would help with this picture more than the sky does.  In reality I think the shot should be tighter in so there is more focus on the bird.</td>', 'For me there is too much sky and there is nothing in the sky.  It seems as though you were trying to keep in with the rule of thirds here, I would suggest moving the subject to the top third instead of the bottom third, the field would help with this picture more than the sky does.  In reality I think the shot should be tighter in so there is more focus on the bird.', '2007-10-10 22:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4158967, 595911, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice close up here, I really like the colors of that wasp(is it a wasp of some sort?).  I think the composition is great there, the one thing I think that could help it be better is if it was on a different color of flower.  The colors start to blend together a little bit to me.</td>', 'Nice close up here, I really like the colors of that wasp(is it a wasp of some sort?).  I think the composition is great there, the one thing I think that could help it be better is if it was on a different color of flower.  The colors start to blend together a little bit to me.', '2007-10-10 22:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4158994, 598265, 77196, '<td valign="top">That would probably be "Prey". I like the dark bird "hidden" in the bright yellow leaves in the tree.</td>', 'That would probably be "Prey". I like the dark bird "hidden" in the bright yellow leaves in the tree.', '2007-10-10 22:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4158996, 595927, 77196, '<td valign="top">I bet you''ve not gotten this comment before - that would be flora, not fauna. <br/> <br/>I still think this is a very nice shot - not sure I like the OOF stems, but the lighting and reflection are very nice.</td>', 'I bet you''ve not gotten this comment before - that would be flora, not fauna.  I still think this is a very nice shot - not sure I like the OOF stems, but the lighting and reflection are very nice.', '2007-10-10 22:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159001, 596166, 77196, '<td valign="top">Don''t see any fauna - just flora - nice beads on the web, but a little out of focus.</td>', 'Don''t see any fauna - just flora - nice beads on the web, but a little out of focus.', '2007-10-10 22:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159009, 597066, 77196, '<td valign="top">Dislike the out of focus wings - the in-focus face isn''t very interesting.</td>', 'Dislike the out of focus wings - the in-focus face isn''t very interesting.', '2007-10-10 22:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159022, 598044, 77196, '<td valign="top">If it wasn''t for that wire - I hate it when something like that is in the shot and there''s nothing you can do about it.</td>', 'If it wasn''t for that wire - I hate it when something like that is in the shot and there''s nothing you can do about it.', '2007-10-10 22:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159029, 597692, 77196, '<td valign="top">All blurry</td>', 'All blurry', '2007-10-10 22:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159060, 597100, 85155, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot.  The water is a nice clear blue and you filled the frame nicely with the turtle.  The only thing that is distracting to me is the top of the water.  This shot would have been awesome if the turtle was deeper so I couldn''t see the top of the water and I didn''t realize I was in an aquarium of some sort.</td>', 'I really love this shot.  The water is a nice clear blue and you filled the frame nicely with the turtle.  The only thing that is distracting to me is the top of the water.  This shot would have been awesome if the turtle was deeper so I couldn''t see the top of the water and I didn''t realize I was in an aquarium of some sort.', '2007-10-10 22:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159064, 595519, 85155, '<td valign="top">I really like the shadow of the fly.  I think that really adds to this picture.  But for some reason my eye keeps going to the point where all the veins of the leaves meet.  It almost feels like the subject to me.  Overall this is a great shot.</td>', 'I really like the shadow of the fly.  I think that really adds to this picture.  But for some reason my eye keeps going to the point where all the veins of the leaves meet.  It almost feels like the subject to me.  Overall this is a great shot.', '2007-10-10 22:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159069, 596129, 85155, '<td valign="top">I really like the coloring in the eyes of this cat.  The expression (do cats have expressions?) is great.  I have a heard time finding the cat in the picture though, it is too dark, and most of the picture is basically black, I can''t really make out the cat except for its face.  I actually think this would  have been a much more appealing shot if it was a tighter shot on the face, try cropping it and see what it looks like.</td>', 'I really like the coloring in the eyes of this cat.  The expression (do cats have expressions?) is great.  I have a heard time finding the cat in the picture though, it is too dark, and most of the picture is basically black, I can''t really make out the cat except for its face.  I actually think this would  have been a much more appealing shot if it was a tighter shot on the face, try cropping it and see what it looks like.', '2007-10-10 22:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159070, 598410, 85155, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite shot of the bunch.  I love the expression, do monkeys have expressions, on the face, the whole thinking man type feel.  The background is nice and simple as to not distract from the picture and I love the colors and contrast.  This is a ribbon winner in my opinion.</td>', 'This is my favorite shot of the bunch.  I love the expression, do monkeys have expressions, on the face, the whole thinking man type feel.  The background is nice and simple as to not distract from the picture and I love the colors and contrast.  This is a ribbon winner in my opinion.', '2007-10-10 22:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159072, 597316, 85155, '<td valign="top">I love the curve formed by these birds and the silhouette affect just adds to the overall composition.  This is a great shot and, in my opinion, should get a ribbon.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I love the curve formed by these birds and the silhouette affect just adds to the overall composition.  This is a great shot and, in my opinion, should get a ribbon.  Nicely done.', '2007-10-10 22:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159073, 598018, 85155, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a great shot, it just jumped out at me when I was scanning through the thumbnails.  You did a great job filling the frame and taking advantage of a simple background.  It is nice that you stopped the action in the wings, but they aren''t completely stopped so I don''t get the feeling like the dove is just  magically hanging in the air.  This should be a ribbon winner for sure.</td>', 'Wow, this is a great shot, it just jumped out at me when I was scanning through the thumbnails.  You did a great job filling the frame and taking advantage of a simple background.  It is nice that you stopped the action in the wings, but they aren''t completely stopped so I don''t get the feeling like the dove is just  magically hanging in the air.  This should be a ribbon winner for sure.', '2007-10-10 22:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159081, 596721, 85155, '<td valign="top">This picture is hard on my eyes for some reason.  I think its because the center of the flower is so blurry.  I''m sure you did that on purpose, but I think that is part of the subject, the bee getting at the nectar, so I want to look there, but because it isn''t sharp it is very distracting.</td>', 'This picture is hard on my eyes for some reason.  I think its because the center of the flower is so blurry.  I''m sure you did that on purpose, but I think that is part of the subject, the bee getting at the nectar, so I want to look there, but because it isn''t sharp it is very distracting.', '2007-10-10 22:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159082, 598177, 85155, '<td valign="top">I think your subject is great, I really like how the monkey is looking through the rest of the photograph.  The background is a bit too busy for me and it makes the photo seem a little flat.</td>', 'I think your subject is great, I really like how the monkey is looking through the rest of the photograph.  The background is a bit too busy for me and it makes the photo seem a little flat.', '2007-10-10 22:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159089, 596106, 85155, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would have better affect if the deer had somewhere to go.  It looks like it is walking and looking off the picture.  I am glad to see the catch light in its eyes so it doesn''t look dead.  I also like how the grass isn''t plain old boring grass, the leaves are a nice addition.</td>', 'I think this photo would have better affect if the deer had somewhere to go.  It looks like it is walking and looking off the picture.  I am glad to see the catch light in its eyes so it doesn''t look dead.  I also like how the grass isn''t plain old boring grass, the leaves are a nice addition.', '2007-10-10 22:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159094, 595502, 85155, '<td valign="top">I really love the subject here.  I think you did a great job capturing the emotion in this cat.  I am not sure why the other cat and the man are in the background though, it ruins the picture for me.</td>', 'I really love the subject here.  I think you did a great job capturing the emotion in this cat.  I am not sure why the other cat and the man are in the background though, it ruins the picture for me.', '2007-10-10 23:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159099, 598244, 85155, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how you would get around this, but the hands, especially the right hand, blends in too much, it is hard to make out the full features of the gorilla.  I think it is just too dark, they eye is hard to make out on that side too.</td>', 'I don''t know how you would get around this, but the hands, especially the right hand, blends in too much, it is hard to make out the full features of the gorilla.  I think it is just too dark, they eye is hard to make out on that side too.', '2007-10-10 23:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159104, 597552, 85155, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an expression here.  This cat is on the move and ready to pounce.  I love the motion blur, but the face is still very sharp.  Nice picture.</td>', 'Wow, what an expression here.  This cat is on the move and ready to pounce.  I love the motion blur, but the face is still very sharp.  Nice picture.', '2007-10-10 23:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159106, 598276, 85155, '<td valign="top">This shot just doesn''t do it for me, maybe its because I don''t really like ducks, and maybe because this duck isn''t that pretty.  The composition is great, the colors could be a little brighter.  I do like that the background seems natural and is simple as to not distract from the rest of the picture.</td>', 'This shot just doesn''t do it for me, maybe its because I don''t really like ducks, and maybe because this duck isn''t that pretty.  The composition is great, the colors could be a little brighter.  I do like that the background seems natural and is simple as to not distract from the rest of the picture.', '2007-10-10 23:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159111, 597910, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like the balance in this shot, it definitely leads me up to the taller giraffe.  They seem to be enjoying their autumn view alright.  I wish they were doing something though, this theme to me is animals doing something, animal life, not just a shot of an animal looking.  Overall great composition.</td>', 'I like the balance in this shot, it definitely leads me up to the taller giraffe.  They seem to be enjoying their autumn view alright.  I wish they were doing something though, this theme to me is animals doing something, animal life, not just a shot of an animal looking.  Overall great composition.', '2007-10-10 23:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159119, 597407, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like how you made the bunny seem smaller by showing us the size of the tree stump it is standing on.  This would look like any other bunny if it was a tight shot.  The subject is too close to the center in this image, for my taste.  Also the background is out of focus, but it takes up most of the image, so it seems like wasted space to me.</td>', 'I like how you made the bunny seem smaller by showing us the size of the tree stump it is standing on.  This would look like any other bunny if it was a tight shot.  The subject is too close to the center in this image, for my taste.  Also the background is out of focus, but it takes up most of the image, so it seems like wasted space to me.', '2007-10-10 23:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159123, 598314, 85155, '<td valign="top">It looks like this little guy is walking out of the picture, try leaving the empty space in front of him rather than behind.  Also this isn''t the most green one I have seen, doesn''t look too much like a leaf, but that has nothing to do with you as a photographer.  I really like the bokeh.</td>', 'It looks like this little guy is walking out of the picture, try leaving the empty space in front of him rather than behind.  Also this isn''t the most green one I have seen, doesn''t look too much like a leaf, but that has nothing to do with you as a photographer.  I really like the bokeh.', '2007-10-10 23:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159128, 597667, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of this butterfly.  I wish it was a tighter picture though, maybe done sideways so you don''t chop of the wings.  I don''t think that the flower adds anything to this composition, so get rid of it.</td>', 'Nice shot of this butterfly.  I wish it was a tighter picture though, maybe done sideways so you don''t chop of the wings.  I don''t think that the flower adds anything to this composition, so get rid of it.', '2007-10-10 23:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159152, 597150, 85155, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is really dark.  Either use a higher ISO, but not too high to make it grainy, or use a tripod so you can use a longer shutter speed.</td>', 'The lighting here is really dark.  Either use a higher ISO, but not too high to make it grainy, or use a tripod so you can use a longer shutter speed.', '2007-10-10 23:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159155, 597014, 85155, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, although I think an angle coming from the front rather than the back might be more interesting, but it is hard to tell without seeing it.  The c-curve in the neck adds to the composition.</td>', 'I really like this shot, although I think an angle coming from the front rather than the back might be more interesting, but it is hard to tell without seeing it.  The c-curve in the neck adds to the composition.', '2007-10-10 23:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159156, 595351, 85155, '<td valign="top">Try putting the subject in a different spot in the picture.  It looks like the bird is flying out of the frame.  The stuff at the bottom probably helps add to the picture more than the blue sky does anyway.  Try framing the bird at the top right.</td>', 'Try putting the subject in a different spot in the picture.  It looks like the bird is flying out of the frame.  The stuff at the bottom probably helps add to the picture more than the blue sky does anyway.  Try framing the bird at the top right.', '2007-10-10 23:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159159, 597515, 85155, '<td valign="top">The squirrel blends in too much with the tree, it is hard to make out what is tree and what is squirrel.</td>', 'The squirrel blends in too much with the tree, it is hard to make out what is tree and what is squirrel.', '2007-10-10 23:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159164, 596109, 85155, '<td valign="top">I have been looking at this picture for a while now, and I still can''t figure out what it is.  Maybe its face is behind that paw?  Try to lighten up the image a bit.</td>', 'I have been looking at this picture for a while now, and I still can''t figure out what it is.  Maybe its face is behind that paw?  Try to lighten up the image a bit.', '2007-10-10 23:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159170, 598013, 85155, '<td valign="top">This picture would have more of an affect on me if it wasn''t in someone''s hand.  The hand is really distracting to me.</td>', 'This picture would have more of an affect on me if it wasn''t in someone''s hand.  The hand is really distracting to me.', '2007-10-10 23:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159175, 596941, 85155, '<td valign="top">Either zoom out or get more of the bull''s face in the shot.  If the eye is really your focal point it is hard to tell because it is almost out of the picture.  The horns seem to be the subject here.</td>', 'Either zoom out or get more of the bull''s face in the shot.  If the eye is really your focal point it is hard to tell because it is almost out of the picture.  The horns seem to be the subject here.', '2007-10-10 23:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159176, 595099, 85155, '<td valign="top">This images seems blurry to me.</td>', 'This images seems blurry to me.', '2007-10-10 23:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159182, 597585, 85155, '<td valign="top">This shot is too busy for me, there isn''t a clear subject.</td>', 'This shot is too busy for me, there isn''t a clear subject.', '2007-10-10 23:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159184, 597631, 85155, '<td valign="top">Great bokeh in this shot.</td>', 'Great bokeh in this shot.', '2007-10-10 23:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159189, 597329, 85155, '<td valign="top">This shot looks to posed to me.  If you are going to catch the guy and put him on your backdrop at least use a flash and get rid of the shadow.  This would have been better nature rather than posed.</td>', 'This shot looks to posed to me.  If you are going to catch the guy and put him on your backdrop at least use a flash and get rid of the shadow.  This would have been better nature rather than posed.', '2007-10-10 23:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159191, 597943, 85155, '<td valign="top">The flower is too close in color to the bee, it is easy to lose the bee in the flower.</td>', 'The flower is too close in color to the bee, it is easy to lose the bee in the flower.', '2007-10-10 23:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159200, 595689, 85155, '<td valign="top">The duck is almost out of the picture, try to put the empty space in front of it rather than behind it.</td>', 'The duck is almost out of the picture, try to put the empty space in front of it rather than behind it.', '2007-10-10 23:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159202, 597625, 85155, '<td valign="top">This would have a better affect if someone wasn''t holding the duck.</td>', 'This would have a better affect if someone wasn''t holding the duck.', '2007-10-10 23:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159206, 596208, 85155, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the lighting on this.  I actually think it would make a great picture if the lighting was better.</td>', 'I don''t like the lighting on this.  I actually think it would make a great picture if the lighting was better.', '2007-10-10 23:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159208, 596589, 85155, '<td valign="top">The birds are hard to see in this photo, it is too dark and they blend right in with the dirt.  Also try not to put your horizon right in the middle of the shot.</td>', 'The birds are hard to see in this photo, it is too dark and they blend right in with the dirt.  Also try not to put your horizon right in the middle of the shot.', '2007-10-10 23:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159209, 598417, 85155, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  The wrinkles in the trunk are so clear and add depth to the picture.  Great composition.</td>', 'I love this shot.  The wrinkles in the trunk are so clear and add depth to the picture.  Great composition.', '2007-10-10 23:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159211, 598419, 85155, '<td valign="top">This was starting to look like a great picture, until it fully loaded and all I could see was a yellow duck.  It was hard to look at anything else.</td>', 'This was starting to look like a great picture, until it fully loaded and all I could see was a yellow duck.  It was hard to look at anything else.', '2007-10-10 23:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159214, 596578, 85155, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection in the water, this is a great shot.</td>', 'Nice reflection in the water, this is a great shot.', '2007-10-10 23:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159221, 597929, 85155, '<td valign="top">I wish this shot was closer to the bison.  It is hard to tell they are there, it seems as though the steam is the subject.</td>', 'I wish this shot was closer to the bison.  It is hard to tell they are there, it seems as though the steam is the subject.', '2007-10-10 23:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159225, 597933, 85155, '<td valign="top">Yes we are, but there are tons of opportunities to take shots of people.  I don''t think this really fits the theme at all.</td>', 'Yes we are, but there are tons of opportunities to take shots of people.  I don''t think this really fits the theme at all.', '2007-10-10 23:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159230, 596735, 85155, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, the problem is somebody else did almost the exact same thing, but there''s is a little bit better.  I would have rated you higher had I not seen the other picture to compare this against.</td>', 'I like this shot, the problem is somebody else did almost the exact same thing, but there''s is a little bit better.  I would have rated you higher had I not seen the other picture to compare this against.', '2007-10-10 23:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159235, 595927, 85155, '<td valign="top">Is this an animal?  I can''t tell what it is.</td>', 'Is this an animal?  I can''t tell what it is.', '2007-10-10 23:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159241, 595614, 85155, '<td valign="top">This shot is really blown out.  It is kind of distracting from the subject.</td>', 'This shot is really blown out.  It is kind of distracting from the subject.', '2007-10-10 23:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159244, 598189, 85155, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, I actually thought the jellyfish was in the air for a second.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, I actually thought the jellyfish was in the air for a second.', '2007-10-10 23:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159256, 596286, 84824, '<td valign="top">would rather see just the zebra alone..i really like it though</td>', 'would rather see just the zebra alone..i really like it though', '2007-10-11 00:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159272, 598169, 84824, '<td valign="top">disturbing...but good</td>', 'disturbing...but good', '2007-10-11 00:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159279, 598392, 83313, '<td valign="top">The tone is a little dull. It could easily be bumped up a bit and the detail in the shadows brought out. I like the pose of the Kangaroo.</td>', 'The tone is a little dull. It could easily be bumped up a bit and the detail in the shadows brought out. I like the pose of the Kangaroo.', '2007-10-11 00:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159280, 596219, 84824, '<td valign="top">beautiful...love the lines in your composition</td>', 'beautiful...love the lines in your composition', '2007-10-11 00:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159282, 598142, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice look of the water in the background. A lot of his head is in shadows, don''t know if that could be brought out any more or not. Otherwise, it''s putting my own entry to shame.</td>', 'Nice look of the water in the background. A lot of his head is in shadows, don''t know if that could be brought out any more or not. Otherwise, it''s putting my own entry to shame.', '2007-10-11 00:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159284, 597952, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Good detail showing on his fur.</td>', 'Nicely done. Good detail showing on his fur.', '2007-10-11 00:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159289, 597667, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not as saturated as I usually see this sort of subject. That''s not a bad thing though. Makes you pay attention to the details instead of the colors.</td>', 'Not as saturated as I usually see this sort of subject. That''s not a bad thing though. Makes you pay attention to the details instead of the colors.', '2007-10-11 00:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159292, 595519, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed that you could even get near one of these to get this close a shot. It seems a touch over-enhanced perhaps. Hard to tell, flys have shiny abdomens anyway.</td>', 'I''m amazed that you could even get near one of these to get this close a shot. It seems a touch over-enhanced perhaps. Hard to tell, flys have shiny abdomens anyway.', '2007-10-11 00:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159294, 596129, 83313, '<td valign="top">Really dark. Looks snap-shottish in nature.</td>', 'Really dark. Looks snap-shottish in nature.', '2007-10-11 00:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159297, 596516, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very cool looking. I''ve never heard of one of those before. The water looks crystal clear and the colors are bright.</td>', 'Very cool looking. I''ve never heard of one of those before. The water looks crystal clear and the colors are bright.', '2007-10-11 00:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4159301, 595689, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the appearance of the water, but the duck lacks detail, I can''t even make out his eyes.</td>', 'I like the appearance of the water, but the duck lacks detail, I can''t even make out his eyes.', '2007-10-11 00:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
