(4159550, 598263, 24486, '<td valign="top">I''m sure everyone is bagging you about the size of the dimensions used here. All I will say on that is set your longest dimension, in this case the width to 640 in your editing software. The butterfly itself looks to be over saturated to the point where you have lost detail that would have helped even a small photograph like this one. Nice DOF though.</td>', 'I''m sure everyone is bagging you about the size of the dimensions used here. All I will say on that is set your longest dimension, in this case the width to 640 in your editing software. The butterfly itself looks to be over saturated to the point where you have lost detail that would have helped even a small photograph like this one. Nice DOF though.', '2007-10-11 04:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
