(4162161, 598330, 65811, '<td valign="top">OMG that''s a gorgeous animal.  Some of the white areas seem a little blown out.  This kitty looks good enough to pet! ..... well, sort of :P.</td>', 'OMG that''s a gorgeous animal.  Some of the white areas seem a little blown out.  This kitty looks good enough to pet! ..... well, sort of :P.', '2007-10-12 07:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
