(4162206, 598033, 65811, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, but the bee gets lost in the yellow.  Some may say that the lighting is harsh, but I like it.  The shadows create a nice dimension.</td>', 'Nice macro, but the bee gets lost in the yellow.  Some may say that the lighting is harsh, but I like it.  The shadows create a nice dimension.', '2007-10-12 07:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
