(4162219, 596783, 65811, '<td valign="top">Awe, what a sweet capture!  Mommy looks very contented.  The greens seem to be dominant here, where as I would like to have seen more reds.  But that''s just my personal preference :).</td>', 'Awe, what a sweet capture!  Mommy looks very contented.  The greens seem to be dominant here, where as I would like to have seen more reds.  But that''s just my personal preference :).', '2007-10-12 08:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
