(4162230, 595307, 65811, '<td valign="top">These little guys are so psychadelic!  He doesn''t look real!  The focus is soft, and the lighting harsh; but the color is good, and I like the overall composition.</td>', 'These little guys are so psychadelic!  He doesn''t look real!  The focus is soft, and the lighting harsh; but the color is good, and I like the overall composition.', '2007-10-12 08:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
