(4162949, 597910, 50804, '<td valign="top">Interesting conundrum in this one ... ideally you would crop it so the cement wall doesn''t show, so that it looks like a more natural scene.  However, since they''re down in a pit if you cropped out the wall (which is acting as a reference) they''d look like the shortest giraffes ever against the trees.  :-)</td>', 'Interesting conundrum in this one ... ideally you would crop it so the cement wall doesn''t show, so that it looks like a more natural scene.  However, since they''re down in a pit if you cropped out the wall (which is acting as a reference) they''d look like the shortest giraffes ever against the trees.  :-)', '2007-10-12 13:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4162957, 595365, 50804, '<td valign="top">AMAZING detail in the eye, and the other colors are great too, with acceptable DOF for a shot like this!</td>', 'AMAZING detail in the eye, and the other colors are great too, with acceptable DOF for a shot like this!', '2007-10-12 13:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
