(4163585, 597421, 62249, '<td valign="top">Spider and web shots are all too common. To make yours stand out, you need to have spectacular lighting, sharp focus on the main point of interest, an uncommon point of view, clever use of depth of field, or some other catchy aspect to the shot. Otherwise, it''s just another boring snapshot of a spider in a web.</td>', 'Spider and web shots are all too common. To make yours stand out, you need to have spectacular lighting, sharp focus on the main point of interest, an uncommon point of view, clever use of depth of field, or some other catchy aspect to the shot. Otherwise, it''s just another boring snapshot of a spider in a web.', '2007-10-12 18:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
