(4165297, 597929, 42254, '<td valign="top">The steam in the foreground detracts from the bison, and they are too small to be seen clearly. Have you tried a crop at the river in front of the bison to zero in on them and to reduce the vapor cloud?</td>', 'The steam in the foreground detracts from the bison, and they are too small to be seen clearly. Have you tried a crop at the river in front of the bison to zero in on them and to reduce the vapor cloud?', '2007-10-13 20:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
