(4166288, 598127, 23251, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp image but lacks punch, I would have cropped out the bridge in the background and maybe closser to his tail feathers.</td>', 'Nice crisp image but lacks punch, I would have cropped out the bridge in the background and maybe closser to his tail feathers.', '2007-10-14 09:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
