(4166780, 597942, 84736, '<td valign="top">DOF is nice, but the highlights are overexposed in the head ruffle. the lens flair is also distracting. otherwise it is nice.</td>', 'DOF is nice, but the highlights are overexposed in the head ruffle. the lens flair is also distracting. otherwise it is nice.', '2007-10-14 15:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
