(4166872, 595351, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good use of negative space. Highlights on the bird are a little blown out, but you don''t have time to make fine adjustments to the camera when a shot like this comes along.</td>', 'A good use of negative space. Highlights on the bird are a little blown out, but you don''t have time to make fine adjustments to the camera when a shot like this comes along.', '2007-10-14 16:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
