(4169195, 597972, 40580, '<td valign="top">Oh, tough subject to capture.  You don''t have much detail in the swans, but I''m sure that''s hard to get.  <br/> <br/>Really, this image doesn''t do anything for me.  It just looks like a nice snapshot.  Maybe a different crop would work.  It''s disturbing that they''re about to swim off frame, so maybe putting them in the upper left would''ve been more pleasing.  Also getting a calmer waters would show the reflections better (of course, I have no clue how you would do that).<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Oh, tough subject to capture.  You don''t have much detail in the swans, but I''m sure that''s hard to get.   Really, this image doesn''t do anything for me.  It just looks like a nice snapshot.  Maybe a different crop would work.  It''s disturbing that they''re about to swim off frame, so maybe putting them in the upper left would''ve been more pleasing.  Also getting a calmer waters would show the reflections better (of course, I have no clue how you would do that). Good luck.', '2007-10-15 13:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
