(4169502, 595025, 85383, '<td valign="top">Love it love it love it. Not only are they eating, but eating out of a cupcake wrapper...awesome. Great focus.</td>', 'Love it love it love it. Not only are they eating, but eating out of a cupcake wrapper...awesome. Great focus.', '2007-10-15 16:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
