(4170990, 596208, 24486, '<td valign="top">Your probabably pushing your luck a bit here. I am a fan of black &amp; white photography &amp; the use of shadow but to be honest neither of these is helping. The fact that it is not clearly in focus is also not helping but worst of all, you used an ornament. If your going for the brown ribbon, I think you are a contender.</td>', 'Your probabably pushing your luck a bit here. I am a fan of black & white photography & the use of shadow but to be honest neither of these is helping. The fact that it is not clearly in focus is also not helping but worst of all, you used an ornament. If your going for the brown ribbon, I think you are a contender.', '2007-10-16 03:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4170995, 595099, 24486, '<td valign="top">Good concept &amp; good title but it is way too out of focus to score well in DPC. I would suggest that you take the photograph in the day time or in a much better lit enviroment to improve your lighting. I don''t know what your lighting source here is but it is also hurting your photograph. If you can, try to capture detail in the dogs fur. Dpcers seem to score better for that. I hope this helps.</td>', 'Good concept & good title but it is way too out of focus to score well in DPC. I would suggest that you take the photograph in the day time or in a much better lit enviroment to improve your lighting. I don''t know what your lighting source here is but it is also hurting your photograph. If you can, try to capture detail in the dogs fur. Dpcers seem to score better for that. I hope this helps.', '2007-10-16 03:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
