(4171873, 598147, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great patience!  I meant you, not the bird.  :P  How long did you wait?  Very nice shot.  My only minor complaint is it seems like there''s some detail missing in the feathers, like noise reduction was a tad heavy.  Of course, that could just be the way this bird is...  :)</td>', 'Great patience!  I meant you, not the bird.  :P  How long did you wait?  Very nice shot.  My only minor complaint is it seems like there''s some detail missing in the feathers, like noise reduction was a tad heavy.  Of course, that could just be the way this bird is...  :)', '2007-10-16 14:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4171875, 597333, 75871, '<td valign="top">Good macro work and great title</td>', 'Good macro work and great title', '2007-10-16 14:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
