(4173423, 598125, 66597, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo! Congrats Lisa! What a beautiful photo and great placing!</td>', 'Woo hoo! Congrats Lisa! What a beautiful photo and great placing!', '2007-10-17 01:15:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4173433, 597552, 39830, '<td valign="top">First of all, thanks to all of you who commented and voted. A very special thanks going out to Gelert who selected it as a favorite. <br/>Creature hit the nail on the head. The blur comes from camera shake and not motion blur. It was a hand-held shot and taken at the local zoo. This guy was actually sitting in the back of his habitat when we showed up, then he wandered out and I swear began posing for all the people with cameras, including a flurry of roars. Perhaps reminders to anyone thinking of jumping the fence to get a closer shot (well, it did cross my mind). In this shot he was actually stretching. I really liked that his hind quarters being in the air made the illusion that he was caught in mid-leap. This shot was my first to score above a 6, so I am very pleased with the results.<br/>Jack</td>', 'First of all, thanks to all of you who commented and voted. A very special thanks going out to Gelert who selected it as a favorite. Creature hit the nail on the head. The blur comes from camera shake and not motion blur. It was a hand-held shot and taken at the local zoo. This guy was actually sitting in the back of his habitat when we showed up, then he wandered out and I swear began posing for all the people with cameras, including a flurry of roars. Perhaps reminders to anyone thinking of jumping the fence to get a closer shot (well, it did cross my mind). In this shot he was actually stretching. I really liked that his hind quarters being in the air made the illusion that he was caught in mid-leap. This shot was my first to score above a 6, so I am very pleased with the results.Jack', '2007-10-17 01:15:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4173458, 597042, 74605, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Eve!  A personal high!  Wow!  And the image is incredible!  Great job!</td>', 'Congratulations Eve!  A personal high!  Wow!  And the image is incredible!  Great job!', '2007-10-17 01:20:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4173468, 597444, 8367, '<td valign="top">Welcome back. A beautiful capture of a beauty of a subject...those eyes are mesmerizing.</td>', 'Welcome back. A beautiful capture of a beauty of a subject...those eyes are mesmerizing.', '2007-10-17 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4173524, 596838, 74979, '<td valign="top">sorry Janey didnt vote this challnge<br/>this is a beautiful bird<br/>those colors are great!<br/> <br/>Anni</td>', 'sorry Janey didnt vote this challngethis is a beautiful birdthose colors are great! Anni', '2007-10-17 01:30:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4173544, 597042, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your personal best!  This shot has so much fun in it - the colors, the poses, and the ironic title. :)</td>', 'Congrats on your personal best!  This shot has so much fun in it - the colors, the poses, and the ironic title. :)', '2007-10-17 01:33:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4173585, 596838, 43148, '<td valign="top">Coming from one finishing so close to this, cannot understand why no one commented on it, I think it is a great capture, how anyone could vote it under 5 is beyond me, but......., dof, colors, focus all look great, only thing I can think of to do to help it a little bit is the crop, would leave a little more space to the right side, giving the bird a bit of space to enter, otherwise not much from me! <br/> <br/>Jacque</td>', 'Coming from one finishing so close to this, cannot understand why no one commented on it, I think it is a great capture, how anyone could vote it under 5 is beyond me, but......., dof, colors, focus all look great, only thing I can think of to do to help it a little bit is the crop, would leave a little more space to the right side, giving the bird a bit of space to enter, otherwise not much from me!  Jacque', '2007-10-17 01:40:39.000000', NULL, 0),
