(4173855, 597928, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lesley - love the title and the soft muted colours here.<br/> <br/>I think this is a really great shot, the problem is it takes a moment to actually absorb it and enjoy it. That loses you all the voteres that flick through  :-  (<br/> <br/>If the rain could have been a tiny bit clearer I think it would have helped people understand the whole picture more - but great shot nevertheless.<br/> <br/>You''re just too subtle for some folk  :-  )</td>', 'Lesley - love the title and the soft muted colours here. I think this is a really great shot, the problem is it takes a moment to actually absorb it and enjoy it. That loses you all the voteres that flick through  :-  ( If the rain could have been a tiny bit clearer I think it would have helped people understand the whole picture more - but great shot nevertheless. You''re just too subtle for some folk  :-  )', '2007-10-17 03:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
