(4173894, 598082, 76430, '<td valign="top">I agree with the comments that pulling back to get the full crest and saturating the colors a bit more would have helped.  I gave it a 5, but with those improvements would have given probably a 7.</td>', 'I agree with the comments that pulling back to get the full crest and saturating the colors a bit more would have helped.  I gave it a 5, but with those improvements would have given probably a 7.', '2007-10-17 03:40:41.000000', NULL, 0),
