(4173980, 596721, 77287, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by silverscreen:</b></div><hr/><i> Somehow this reminds me of something I''ve seen before. I wonder what it can be...?<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=570001" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/727/120/570001.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/727/120/570001.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/727/120/570001.jpg"/></a> <br/>;-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That freaked me out.<br/> <br/>I had never seen your picture I swear.<br/> <br/>I went out for a walk on the Sunday morning when the challenge closed and it was about the last picture I took on the way home. I spent quite a bit of time choosing the best crop an what I ended up with seemed the most natural due to the curves in the flower.<br/> <br/>I guess great minds think alike ;-)<br/> <br/>I guess there is very little that hasn''t been done before in photography.<br/>Regards<br/>Bob</td>', 'Originally posted by silverscreen: Somehow this reminds me of something I''ve seen before. I wonder what it can be...? ;-)   That freaked me out. I had never seen your picture I swear. I went out for a walk on the Sunday morning when the challenge closed and it was about the last picture I took on the way home. I spent quite a bit of time choosing the best crop an what I ended up with seemed the most natural due to the curves in the flower. I guess great minds think alike ;-) I guess there is very little that hasn''t been done before in photography.RegardsBob', '2007-10-17 04:34:28.000000', NULL, 0),
