(4174076, 597631, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yeah, yeah... I crawl around in dusty hot bunkers with dead plants that are so fragile they vibrate in the slightest breeze, then spend HOURS trying to duplicate the acid action within basic editing rules, and I get beat scorewise by a plastic lizard??  Very cool.  :-)</td>', 'Yeah, yeah... I crawl around in dusty hot bunkers with dead plants that are so fragile they vibrate in the slightest breeze, then spend HOURS trying to duplicate the acid action within basic editing rules, and I get beat scorewise by a plastic lizard??  Very cool.  :-)', '2007-10-17 05:39:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4174084, 597669, 30982, '<td valign="top">My kind of picture - love the geometry of the composition and nice choice of critters.  I miss pigeons.  Really like that there''s lots to see - and love the single pigeon staring at you (more or less) on the back of the wolf.</td>', 'My kind of picture - love the geometry of the composition and nice choice of critters.  I miss pigeons.  Really like that there''s lots to see - and love the single pigeon staring at you (more or less) on the back of the wolf.', '2007-10-17 05:42:12.000000', NULL, 0),
