(4174193, 598125, 68035, '<td valign="top">Oh my word Lisa 4th place!!!!  Wooohooo<br/> <br/>New personal best, third +7 score, and what is more important a great photo.  Goodness you are on a roll at the moment<br/> <br/>Love the sharpness of the shot and the expression that you have captured.  For some reason I am generally not a big fan of orangutan''s (great pun by the way) but even I have to say that this image is incredible<br/> <br/>Good job buddy!!!!!!</td>', 'Oh my word Lisa 4th place!!!!  Wooohooo New personal best, third +7 score, and what is more important a great photo.  Goodness you are on a roll at the moment Love the sharpness of the shot and the expression that you have captured.  For some reason I am generally not a big fan of orangutan''s (great pun by the way) but even I have to say that this image is incredible Good job buddy!!!!!!', '2007-10-17 06:41:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4174197, 596219, 79720, '<td valign="top">What, did you eat Alex''s workflow or something? That''s two Simms'' in a row I''ve mistaken for Sabieris.</td>', 'What, did you eat Alex''s workflow or something? That''s two Simms'' in a row I''ve mistaken for Sabieris.', '2007-10-17 06:43:27.000000', NULL, 0),
