(4174266, 597293, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is excellent.  I just love these pretty little birds.  We have them flying around our house all the time, but they tend to be a little shy.</td>', 'This is excellent.  I just love these pretty little birds.  We have them flying around our house all the time, but they tend to be a little shy.', '2007-10-17 07:04:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4174275, 598158, 67152, '<td valign="top">Good finish Chris!  The focus on the eyes is really good and the composition really works.  I think the only thing that could make this better is a little fix on the beaks blown out area.</td>', 'Good finish Chris!  The focus on the eyes is really good and the composition really works.  I think the only thing that could make this better is a little fix on the beaks blown out area.', '2007-10-17 07:08:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4174281, 597333, 68035, '<td valign="top">Woohoo!!!!!!!! Many many many congratulations on the top ten finish and the great score.  The fact that two people scored this a 1 or 2 is quite frankly risible<br/> <br/>This is a stunning shot that captures both a fantastic animal portrait and also action.  In terms of colour and sharpness the image cannot be faultedand I love the leading diagonal that you have created<br/> <br/>Breathtaking</td>', 'Woohoo!!!!!!!! Many many many congratulations on the top ten finish and the great score.  The fact that two people scored this a 1 or 2 is quite frankly risible This is a stunning shot that captures both a fantastic animal portrait and also action.  In terms of colour and sharpness the image cannot be faultedand I love the leading diagonal that you have created Breathtaking', '2007-10-17 07:18:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4174317, 598086, 67258, '<td valign="top">i am SO pleased this got the blue ribbon - it is an amazing photograph and I do hope that you will seek a wider audience for it, perhaps submitting it for a potential book illustration or to a photography magazine?</td>', 'i am SO pleased this got the blue ribbon - it is an amazing photograph and I do hope that you will seek a wider audience for it, perhaps submitting it for a potential book illustration or to a photography magazine?', '2007-10-17 07:47:53.000000', NULL, 0),
