(4174674, 596219, 66348, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful shot. I love the way you composed it, and the tonemapping (I believe it was used) really brings out some great detail and colors. I did have this pegged as a Alex shot, but after the challenge seeing that its a "Simms" shot puts it right where it belongs also. Your work is outstanding!! I had this as a top 3! But Congrats on top 10!</td>', 'Such a beautiful shot. I love the way you composed it, and the tonemapping (I believe it was used) really brings out some great detail and colors. I did have this pegged as a Alex shot, but after the challenge seeing that its a "Simms" shot puts it right where it belongs also. Your work is outstanding!! I had this as a top 3! But Congrats on top 10!', '2007-10-17 10:17:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4174679, 595614, 66414, '<td valign="top">This was my first challenge and didn''t know what to expect.  I was a little disapointed in some of the comments.  Mainly, for the people who gave me one word type of comments like "overexposed".  <br/> <br/>I was not sure how to interpret that.  Was their impression that i left the shutter open way too long and didn''t know that the photo was converted to a high-key or did they know I used a high-key to and think it was just way too much.  <br/> <br/>I''m still hoping for comments on the photos,  hoping for some clarification even after the fact.  So if you are reading the comments please let me know what I could have done better.  Or if you did leave one of those comments please elaborate on it.<br/> <br/>Thanks for any comments<br/>Cheers</td>', 'This was my first challenge and didn''t know what to expect.  I was a little disapointed in some of the comments.  Mainly, for the people who gave me one word type of comments like "overexposed".   I was not sure how to interpret that.  Was their impression that i left the shutter open way too long and didn''t know that the photo was converted to a high-key or did they know I used a high-key to and think it was just way too much.   I''m still hoping for comments on the photos,  hoping for some clarification even after the fact.  So if you are reading the comments please let me know what I could have done better.  Or if you did leave one of those comments please elaborate on it. Thanks for any commentsCheers', '2007-10-17 10:19:20.000000', NULL, 0),
