(4174777, 596286, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, WOO HOOOOOO, Sister!!!  Your 2nd highest score.  And what an adorable photo to be staring at you from the 2nd highest place of honor on your profile page.   I LOVE this photo!  LOVE IT!   I''m kinda partial to friendly zebras  :)   I got some favorites at the wildlife ranch the other day.   They are just so darn personable, aren''t they??<br/> <br/>CONGRATULATIONS!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh, WOO HOOOOOO, Sister!!!  Your 2nd highest score.  And what an adorable photo to be staring at you from the 2nd highest place of honor on your profile page.   I LOVE this photo!  LOVE IT!   I''m kinda partial to friendly zebras  :)   I got some favorites at the wildlife ranch the other day.   They are just so darn personable, aren''t they?? CONGRATULATIONS! ', '2007-10-17 10:48:15.000000', NULL, 0),
