(4178958, 598169, 82503, '<td valign="top">Come on, people! Get over the fact that animals eat each other (and we participate, too, in both roles). It just happens to be like this, it''s nature! Are you blaming the snake for eating the mouse? "Bad snake, you should be ashamed of yourself. Go eat your salad." ???<br/> <br/>There are unpleasant things in this world. Not taking pictures of them will not make them go away (and giving such pictures a low rating won''t either).<br/> <br/>And Aleks: I''m still curious to know how you set this up.</td>', 'Come on, people! Get over the fact that animals eat each other (and we participate, too, in both roles). It just happens to be like this, it''s nature! Are you blaming the snake for eating the mouse? "Bad snake, you should be ashamed of yourself. Go eat your salad." ??? There are unpleasant things in this world. Not taking pictures of them will not make them go away (and giving such pictures a low rating won''t either). And Aleks: I''m still curious to know how you set this up.', '2007-10-18 16:06:39.000000', NULL, 0),
