(4193475, 597333, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, RON!!!   <b>BUMMER</b>!!    I am so sorry for you DQ!   <br/> <br/>What an awesome photo.   Auuuuugghh the basic editing thing is so limiting!   <br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh, RON!!!   BUMMER!!    I am so sorry for you DQ!    What an awesome photo.   Auuuuugghh the basic editing thing is so limiting!    ', '2007-10-24 18:49:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4193987, 595593, 24454, '<td valign="top">Dawn!!   This is SO amazing!!!  I''m in awe how you can see this massive amount of birds. . .yet you can actually see facial expression on that one.   What an INTERESTING photo!!!   I love it!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Dawn!!   This is SO amazing!!!  I''m in awe how you can see this massive amount of birds. . .yet you can actually see facial expression on that one.   What an INTERESTING photo!!!   I love it! ', '2007-10-24 23:03:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199495, 597333, 66597, '<td valign="top">Ron, I''m so sorry this got disqualified. I honestly can''t even tell the difference between the one where you evidently cloned a couple of spots and the one where it would have been legal. They must have been the two tiny areas in the black?<br/> <br/>Anyway, I think this is a fantastic capture. You''ve got great composition with the head right up there on the third, a nice diagonal line running through the photo, and it is very sharp, especially considering that I''m sure the lizard was moving. No wonder you have a 6.9+ going on this!</td>', 'Ron, I''m so sorry this got disqualified. I honestly can''t even tell the difference between the one where you evidently cloned a couple of spots and the one where it would have been legal. They must have been the two tiny areas in the black? Anyway, I think this is a fantastic capture. You''ve got great composition with the head right up there on the third, a nice diagonal line running through the photo, and it is very sharp, especially considering that I''m sure the lizard was moving. No wonder you have a 6.9+ going on this!', '2007-10-27 12:57:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4201430, 598125, 34938, '<td valign="top">Lisa, I photographed this same orangutan...great score and a wonderful finish. A PB as well...great work</td>', 'Lisa, I photographed this same orangutan...great score and a wonderful finish. A PB as well...great work', '2007-10-28 14:33:39.000000', NULL, 0),
