(4260091, 595614, 36981, '<td valign="top">I think this is wonderful.  The light plays well with your subject, and the tones are really pretty.  Then again, I''m a fan of high key, so what do I know?<br/> <br/>BTW, although I like this image, I know that if I were one of the commentors below who criticized the image and you didn''t mark the comment as helpful, I''d hesitate to come back to elaborate.  You''ll get a lot more comments &amp; a lot more honesty if it looks like you really want it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-11-20 09:49:21.</i></td>', 'I think this is wonderful.  The light plays well with your subject, and the tones are really pretty.  Then again, I''m a fan of high key, so what do I know? BTW, although I like this image, I know that if I were one of the commentors below who criticized the image and you didn''t mark the comment as helpful, I''d hesitate to come back to elaborate.  You''ll get a lot more comments & a lot more honesty if it looks like you really want it.', '2007-11-20 09:46:37.000000', '2007-11-20 09:49:21.000000', 0),
