(5176995, 596037, 16230, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Zoomdak:</b></div><hr/><i><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pawdrix:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m long suffering from Canon Beach Fatigue. It''s difficult to judge these with an open mind anymore since they are all over the place (by the millions) and it''s tough...nearly impossible to take a bad shot of those rocks. </i></td></tr></table>Trust me, I have plenty of terrible shots of these rocks. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>And if you don''t have enough to satisfy him, then he''s welcome to look at all of my lousy shots. :D<br/> <br/>Nice one David!</td>', 'Originally posted by Zoomdak:Originally posted by pawdrix: I''m long suffering from Canon Beach Fatigue. It''s difficult to judge these with an open mind anymore since they are all over the place (by the millions) and it''s tough...nearly impossible to take a bad shot of those rocks. Trust me, I have plenty of terrible shots of these rocks.  And if you don''t have enough to satisfy him, then he''s welcome to look at all of my lousy shots. :D Nice one David!', '2009-01-07 05:07:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5227914, 598013, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the green background adds anything to the subject and overall feel of this nice spidey macro.  Good subject for macro - even if I detest spiders.  I would crop it down more and maybe add a bit of vignette to focus more on the spider and less on the hand.   In any case...better than what I would do!</td>', 'I''m not sure the green background adds anything to the subject and overall feel of this nice spidey macro.  Good subject for macro - even if I detest spiders.  I would crop it down more and maybe add a bit of vignette to focus more on the spider and less on the hand.   In any case...better than what I would do!', '2009-01-30 18:45:33.000000', NULL, 0),
